<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.description>参与者将在{MOODDAYS}天内获得{MINMOOD}到{MAXMOOD}的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: Insectoid Herder -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.comps.0.label>虫族护工</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! The insects didnt seem to enjoy them at all. -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}非常糟糕！虫族们似乎完全不喜欢死者。</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Lackluster -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>枯燥乏味的</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was lackluster. The speech was long-winded, but at least it looks the insects got something out of it. -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}枯燥乏味。演讲冗长且无趣，不过至少虫族们享用了死者的一部分。</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Good -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>令人满意的</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was good. The insects enjoyed their meal and blessed us with a new holy creature. -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人满意。虫族们享用了这份美餐，并通过诞下神圣的新个体的方式来祝福我们。</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Amazing -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人惊异的</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was heartwarming. The insects appear to have taken full advantage of their nutrients. What a wonderful creature that will become. -->
  <AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人惊异。看起来虫族们充分享用了这份美餐，真好奇它们将会诞下怎样绝妙的新个体。</AM_InsectoidFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  
</LanguageData>